B.beW=s(["Not eating for more than a day. A rabbit that stops eating or pooping needs a vet the same day.","Vomiting or diarrhoea more than once, or lasting more than a day.","Limping, or pain when you touch it.","Scratching a lot, hair loss, shaking the head or a bad smell from the ears.","Drinking or peeing much more than usual.","A lump or swelling that keeps growing.","A red, cloudy or watery eye.","Hiding, low energy or a sudden change in behaviour.","For danger signs like trouble breathing, heavy bleeding or poisoning, open Emergency help right away."],t.s)
